. But this, they only made a limited amount. So get on it before it runs out. Link right there in that shopping cart.\",\"callToAction\":\"SEE DETAILS\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://orvyla.com/products/new-deodorant-vanilla-pistachio-fresh-that-lasts-24-hour-odor-control-no-aluminum-baking-soda-parabens-phthalates-ethanol-brightening-smoothing-for-dark-underarms-with-kojic-acid-turmeric-korean-skincare-k-beauty-2189349772\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"orvyla.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"✨ Smell Fresh & Brighten Dark Underarms Naturally\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":69,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"DE\",\"DK\",\"GB\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":true,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1028076683111989\",\"collationId\":\"1725409615141956\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-29T01:47:09.587Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-28T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-06-01T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":4,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/20113e9b8cf478fc7d35cbde2f063df4f3097702c7cabde62c60f166ebd5640a.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c2069a03769c7aa3299633c024dc4c9aff20187ae06c4cdbde00e15231a303a5.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"953915054477847\",\"name\":\"Orvyla-\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/953915054477847.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"953915054477847\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":2003,\"totalReach\":581925,\"countriesCount\":3,\"facebookLikes\":539,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"Still worried about underarm odor or dark underarms? 😩\\nThis Vanilla Pistachio Deodorant keeps y