{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GLSKpxZ8chWsdJrcJ1iCyd","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"requestId\":\"cdc9be13-3d48-4a48-a39b-9d5fb95b066a\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"facebook_1570204607978188\",\"collationId\":\"1052121440716431\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-18T04:14:55.250Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-06-17T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-06-20T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":3,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/25c9c290dfccb3e5fa8393dbe4ee9312e466c1a300f3a5a6244043ac387cf955.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c4d043ed4aa9d87930d9e49795f7c7641179dcbf54f627477474531fdcd15275.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"1201303243061784\",\"name\":\"Polynae\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/1201303243061784.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"1201303243061784\",\"liveAdsCount\":1,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":3597,\"countriesCount\":4,\"facebookLikes\":3,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"If you can't lift your arms without feeling self-conscious, this is for you. 🙋\u200d♀️\\n\\nKojic acid and turmeric in a deodorant. Polynae actually did it.\\nBrightens dark underarms while you wear it. Smells like summer the whole time.\\n\\nAnd it's buy one get one free right now, so grab both while the link works.\\n\\n✨ Kojic acid + turmeric target dark underarm skin\\n🌿 Paraben-free, aluminum-free formula\\n💸 BOGO free today only\\n\\nShop now ➡️ https://polynae.com/products/deodorant-vanilla-pistachio-fresh-that-lasts\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"SHOP NOW\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://polynae.com/products/deodorant-vanilla-pistachio-fresh-that-lasts\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"polynae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Kojic Acid Deodorant. BOGO.\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":1,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1842449900469962\",\"collationId\":\"976081895451679\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-14T14:50:59.992Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-13T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-14T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":1,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/d3038a06ede23193943a53aaaf0189140702209b2e8842d2eeb6455e2deb151e.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/c537f71e6576864e0bc76a9343cf8f792ce2c9bbea2c46b36f95e1a74584eb79.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"429008500303079\",\"name\":\"Ava Condie\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/429008500303079.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"429008500303079\",\"liveAdsCount\":0,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":0,\"countriesCount\":1,\"facebookLikes\":440,\"instagramFollowers\":null},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"I didn't think a deodorant could actually change my skin tone until I tried this.\\n\\nNo aluminum. Just turmeric + kojic acid doing the actual work — the same ingredients dermatologists use for dark spots, now living in something you swipe on every morning. And it smells like vanilla and pistachio, not like a chemistry experiment.\\n\\nMy underarms are visibly brighter and I finally don't think twice before raising my arms.\\n\\n👉 https://niptic.com/pages/listicle-deodorant-7-reasons\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":\"LEARN MORE\",\"landingPageUrl\":\"https://niptic.com/pages/listicle-deodorant-7-reasons\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"niptic.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Learn the benefits of turmeric + kojic acid deodorant →\",\"ctaLin