/products/deodorant-vanilla-pistachio-fresh-that-lasts\",\"landingPageDomain\":\"polynae.com\",\"ctaDescription\":\"Kojic Acid Deodorant, BOGO Now\",\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":1,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":[\"AU\",\"CA\",\"GB\",\"US\"],\"mainCountry\":\"GB\",\"gender\":\"all\",\"ageMin\":18,\"ageMax\":65},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":true,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_2131963734038725\",\"collationId\":\"1008187144967754\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-19T23:00:48.408Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-05-15T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-01T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":78,\"media\":{\"type\":\"image\",\"thumbnailUrl\":null,\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/image/4aeb94eb85acf31666d5238d0688d229135104b417135250cba755978c9b7025.jpg\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"105882225559994\",\"name\":\"Blank Beauty\",\"logoUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/profile_picture/105882225559994.jpg\",\"facebookPageId\":\"105882225559994\",\"liveAdsCount\":14,\"reach30d\":0,\"totalReach\":0,\"countriesCount\":null,\"facebookLikes\":603,\"instagramFollowers\":22180},\"content\":{\"title\":null,\"body\":\"اسمرار في مناطق حساسة؟\\nموضوع كثير يحرجن منه — ولازم يتكلمن عنه بصراحة 🤍\\nالحل موجود، ومحترم، وفعّال:\\n🤍 Whitening Balm For Sensitive Areas — بلسم مصمّم خصيصًا للمناطق الحساسة، يوحّد اللون ويقلل الاسمرار بلطف شديد دون تهيّج. ترطيب + تفتيح = ثقة يومية\\n🌿 Kojic Acid Deodorant Roll-on — مزيل رائحة يومي بحمض الكوجيك، يقلل اسمرار الإبط تدريجيًا ويعطيك نعومة وانتعاشًا طوال اليوم. بدون ألومنيوم — آمن للاستخدام اليومي ✅\\nبلسم + مزيل = روتين يومي بسيط… ونتيجة تبين مع الوقت 💪\\n💌 ابعثي هذا البوست لأي وحدة تعرفين إنها تبحث عن حل — أحيانًا ناس محتاجة تشوف الحل قبل ما تدور عليه 💙\\n\\n🔎 تلقين هالمنتجات بسهولة في بلانك ستور — دوّري عليها بالـ SKU:\\n➡️ ALSH4299 | ALSH4283\\n\\nDarkening in sensitive areas?\\nIt's more common than you think — and there's a gentle, effective solution for it:\\n🤍 Whitening Balm For Sensitive Areas — A specially formulated balm that gently brightens and evens skin tone in delicate areas without irritation. Moisturizing and brightening in one daily step\\n🌿 Kojic Acid Deodorant Roll-on — A daily roll-on with Kojic Acid that gradually fades underarm darkening while keeping you fresh all day. Aluminum-free and safe for sensitive skin ✅\\nBalm + Roll-on = a daily ritual that builds confidence over time 🌸\\nSend this to someone who's been looking for a gentle solution — sometimes people just need to see it first 🤍\\n\\nFind them easily on Blank Store — just search their SKUs:\\n➡️ ALSH4299 | ALSH4283\",\"transcript\":null,\"callToAction\":null,\"landingPageUrl\":null,\"landingPageDomain\":null,\"ctaDescription\":null,\"ctaLinkDescription\":null},\"metrics\":{\"reach\":null,\"aggregatedReach\":null,\"estimatedSpend\":null,\"duplicates\":1,\"reachDelta1d\":null,\"reachDelta7d\":null,\"reachDelta30d\":null},\"audience\":{\"targetedCountries\":null,\"mainCountry\":null,\"gender\":null,\"ageMin\":null,\"ageMax\":null},\"rank\":null,\"flags\":{\"isEuAd\":null,\"isLowReach\":false,\"isMediaChanged\":true,\"hasPartnerBadge\":false}},{\"id\":\"facebook_1436842405162478\",\"collationId\":\"2605058290010959\",\"platform\":\"facebook\",\"status\":\"inactive\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-14T14:50:59.992Z\",\"firstSeenAt\":\"2026-08-13T07:00:00.000Z\",\"lastSeenAt\":\"2026-08-13T07:00:00.000Z\",\"daysRunning\":0,\"media\":{\"type\":\"video\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/thumbnails/434ed8ff70bf6baf4c527f012658fb8b22c4581993a3a9a32346be3780e68ff8.jpg\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://medias.trendtrack.io/facebook/video/8333c1ffa65b3c1757bf71bce1e70b619d6d4c141a64e1737d8dc710d4f9a2cd.mp4\"},\"advertiser\":{\"id\":\"429008500303079\",\